\n\n## `defineDirectAgent`\n\n用于 direct agent 接入：\n\n```ts\nimport { completeEvidenceCoverage, defineDirectAgent } from \"niceeval/adapter\";\n```\n\n`defineDirectAgent` 产出的 `Agent.kind` 恒为 `\"direct\"`（内部判别字段，不用你声明）。`t` 上没有需要声明才解锁的能力位——`t.sandbox` 这类文件系统断言只在 `defineSandboxAgent` 构造的 Agent（`kind: \"sandbox\"`）上才有；其余由 `send` 实际返回的事件和 `ctx.session` 的使用决定，详见[能力位参考](/zh/reference/capabilities)。字段全集见下方「Agent 与 Adapter Context 字段」。\n\n### direct agent 示例\n\n```ts\nexport default defineDirectAgent({\n  name: \"echo\",\n  evidenceCoverage: completeEvidenceCoverage,\n  async send(input) {\n    return {\n      status: \"completed\",\n      events: [{ type: \"message\", role: \"assistant\", text: input.text }],\n    };\n  },\n});\n```\n\n## `input`(`TurnInput`)\n\n<ResponseField name=\"text\" type=\"string\">\n  当前 `t.send(...)` 传入的文本。\n</ResponseField>\n\n<ResponseField name=\"files\" type=\"readonly InputFile[] | undefined\">\n  本轮附带的文件(图片等)。不支持多模态的 adapter 可以忽略它。\n</ResponseField>\n\n<ResponseField name=\"responses\" type=\"readonly InputResponse[] | undefined\">\n  仅回答轮(`t.respond` / `t.respondAll`)出现:逐请求的结构化回答,按 `requestId` 对位。\n</ResponseField>\n\n## `defineSandboxAgent`\n\n用于 coding agent CLI。产出的 `Agent.kind` 恒为 `\"sandbox\"`——`t.sandbox`、`t.sandbox.fileChanged()` 等文件系统断言只在这类 agent 上解锁。字段全集同样见下方「Agent 与 Adapter Context 字段」的 `SandboxAgentDef`；`ctx.sandbox`(`Sandbox` 接口)的完整方法见再下方「Sandbox 接口」。\n\n```ts\nimport { completeEvidenceCoverage, defineSandboxAgent } from \"niceeval/adapter\";\nimport { command } from \"niceeval/sandbox\";\n\nexport default defineSandboxAgent({\n  name: \"my-cli-agent\",\n  evidenceCoverage: completeEvidenceCoverage,\n  ensure: {\n    identity: { agent: \"my-cli-agent\", version: \"1.0.0\" },\n    probe: command(\"my-agent\", [\"--version\"]),\n  },\n  async send(input, ctx) {\n    await ctx.sandbox.runCommand(\"my-agent\", [\"run\", input.text]);\n    return { status: \"completed\", events: [] };\n  },\n});\n```\n\n## 注册\n\n```ts\nimport { defineExperiment } from \"niceeval\";\nimport echo from \"./agents/echo\";\n\nexport default defineExperiment({\n  agent: echo,\n  attempts: 1,\n});\n```\n\n## Agent 与 Adapter Context 字段\n\n`defineDirectAgent`（`DirectAgentDef`）、`defineSandboxAgent`（`SandboxAgentDef`）的构造参数，\n以及两者的 `send(input, ctx)` 都会拿到的 `ctx`（`AgentContext`）：\n\n{/* GENERATED:BEGIN agent-def */}\n\n{/* 本区块由 pnpm docs:reference 从源码注释生成,勿手改;要改文案,改对应源码的 TSDoc/JSDoc(映射见 scripts/generate-reference.ts) */}\n\n### `DirectAgentDef`\n\n#### `name`\n\n```ts\nname: string;\n```\n\nagent 的显示名/标识,原样进入 `Agent.name`——不是注册表查找 key,只用于展示、结果归属与去重指纹。\n\n#### `evidenceCoverage`\n\n```ts\nevidenceCoverage: EvidenceCoverage;\n```\n\n该 Adapter 的常态证据覆盖声明；完整采集可用 `completeEvidenceCoverage`。\n\n#### `setup`\n\n```ts\nsetup?: DirectAgentSetup;\n```\n\n每个 attempt 一次。Direct Agent 不接收 Sandbox；常用于建立连接、鉴权等一次性准备。\n\n#### `tracing`\n\n```ts\ntracing?: Omit<AgentTracing, \"configure\">;\n```\n\nOTLP 导出配置:被测对象怎么把 trace 发到 endpoint(env-based 注入)。\n\n#### `spanMapper`\n\n```ts\nspanMapper?: SpanMapper;\n```\n\n原生 span → canonical 的薄 mapper;省略走通用 heuristic。只影响瀑布图。\n\n#### `send`\n\n```ts\nsend(input: TurnInput, ctx: AgentContext): Promise<Turn>;\n```\n\n每轮一次:把一轮 prompt 直接发给函数、SDK 或服务端点,解析响应成 events。\n\n#### `classifySendFailure`\n\n```ts\nclassifySendFailure?: SendFailureClassifier;\n```\n\n可选 send 执行失败分类器:见 `Agent.classifySendFailure`。\n\n#### `teardown`\n\n```ts\nteardown?: DirectAgentTeardown;\n```\n\n运行结束前的清理,当且仅当本 attempt 走到过 `setup` 时点才执行(`setup` 抛错不豁免),\n在 finally 里跑一次。\n\n### `SandboxAgentDef`\n\n#### `name`\n\n```ts\nname: string;\n```\n\nagent 的显示名/标识,原样进入 `Agent.name`——不是注册表查找 key,只用于展示、结果归属与去重指纹。\n\n#### `evidenceCoverage`\n\n```ts\nevidenceCoverage: EvidenceCoverage;\n```\n\n该 Adapter 的常态证据覆盖声明；完整采集可用 `completeEvidenceCoverage`。\n\n#### `ensure`\n\n```ts\nensure: AgentEnsure | readonly AgentEnsure[];\n```\n\n单条或数组都按声明顺序规范化为 Agent layer。\n\n#### `installers`\n\n```ts\ninstallers?: readonly AgentInstaller[];\n```\n\n配对安装层；省略表示这个 adapter 只提供 probe 协议，未命中时 Runner 在\n`agent.ensure` 点名缺失的精确 identity。工厂会把省略规范化成空数组。\n\n#### `setup`\n\n```ts\nsetup?: AgentSetup;\n```\n\n每条 Attempt 一次(不是每轮 send 一次):写 config.toml / 鉴权配置(model/base/auth 等\n本 Attempt 内不变的运行配置)。CLI 的 probe、安装与复检属于 `agent.ensure`。运行器在 Sandbox\n备好(layer prepare/ensure/baseline 之后)、第一次 send 前调用一次,不返回值。\n\n#### `tracing`\n\n```ts\ntracing?: AgentTracing;\n```\n\nOTLP 导出配置:Sandbox 里怎么让 CLI 把 trace 发到 endpoint(env / 配置文件),从 setup 拆出。\n\n#### `spanMapper`\n\n```ts\nspanMapper?: SpanMapper;\n```\n\n原生 span → canonical 的薄 mapper;省略走通用 heuristic。只影响瀑布图。\n\n#### `send`\n\n```ts\nsend(input: TurnInput, ctx: SandboxAgentContext): Promise<Turn>;\n```\n\n每轮一次:跑 prompt(fresh / resume)+ 解析成 events。\n\n#### `classifySendFailure`\n\n```ts\nclassifySendFailure?: SendFailureClassifier;\n```\n\n可选 send 执行失败分类器:见 `Agent.classifySendFailure`。\n\n#### `teardown`\n\n```ts\nteardown?: AgentTeardown;\n```\n\nSandbox 销毁前的清理,当且仅当本 attempt 走到过 `setup` 时点才执行(`setup` 抛错不豁免),\n在 finally 里跑一次。\n\n### `AgentContext`\n\n#### `signal`\n\n```ts\nreadonly signal: AbortSignal;\n```\n\n软取消信号:合并了 attempt 超时、run 级中断(用户 Ctrl+C)与评估用例自身的中断请求\n(见 src/runner/attempt.ts)。adapter 可以选择性检查它(或直接传给 `fetch`)以提前\n优雅退出,但这不是唯一的硬边界——即便 adapter 完全忽略它,运行器也会用\n`Effect.timeoutTo` 兜底强制收尾(停 Sandbox 容器)。\n\n---\ntitle: \"标准事件流参考\"\nsidebarTitle: \"事件流\"\ndescription: \"StreamEvent 的十种事件：每种的字段、什么时候吐、哪些断言消费它。adapter 的核心工作就是产出这条流。\"\n---\n\nadapter 的 `send` 返回一个 `Turn`，其中 `events: StreamEvent[]` 是**断言的唯一数据源**：`t.calledTool()`、`t.reply`、`toolOrder`、`noFailedActions`……全部从这条流上读。把你的 agent\"这一轮做了什么\"翻成这条流，整套断言就都能用。\n\n## Turn：send 的返回值\n\n```ts\ninterface Turn {\n  events: StreamEvent[];                          // 本轮事件,按真实发生顺序\n  data?: JsonValue;                               // 结构化输出 → outputEquals / outputMatches\n  status: \"completed\" | \"failed\" | \"waiting\";     // waiting = 停下等人(HITL)\n  usage?: Usage;                                  // → maxTokens / maxCost / 成本报表,完整字段见下方\n}\n```\n\n`data` 的语义是\"本轮的结构化产物\"：**应用的回答本身是结构化对象**（抽取、分类、表单填充）时才填，`out","exit_code":0}},"command":{"kind":"command","original":{"state":"opaque","reason":"unsupported-protocol"},"logical":{"state":"opaque","normalizer":"logical-command/v1","reason":"original-opaque","originalReason":"unsupported-protocol"}},"start":{"turnOrdinal":2,"eventOrdinal":16},"lifecycle":{"state":"available","status":"completed","finish":{"turnOrdinal":2,"eventOrdinal":17}}},{"id":"[\"niceeval.logical-tool-occurrence/1\",\"session-1\",\"turn-2\",2,18]","session":"session-1","turn":"turn-2","name":{"original":"command_execution","canonical":"shell"},"input":{"state":"complete","value":{"command":"/bin/bash -lc \"sed -n '1,130p' letta/server/constants.py && grep -RIn \\\"class LettaStreamingRequest\\\\|class LettaResponse\\\\|class LettaMessage\\\" letta/schemas --include='*.py' | head -n 80\""}},"output":{"state":"complete","value":{"output":"# WebSockets\nWS_DEFAULT_PORT = 8282\nWS_CLIENT_TIMEOUT = 30\n\n# REST\nREST_DEFAULT_PORT = 8283\nletta/schemas/letta_response.py:52:class LettaResponse(BaseModel):\nletta/schemas/letta_request.py:163:class LettaStreamingRequest(LettaRequest):\nletta/schemas/letta_message.py:68:class LettaMessage(BaseModel):\n","exit_code":0}},"command":{"kind":"command","original":{"state":"opaque","reason":"unsupported-protocol"},"logical":{"state":"opaque","normalizer":"logical-command/v1","reason":"original-opaque","originalReason":"unsupported-protocol"}},"start":{"turnOrdinal":2,"eventOrdinal":18},"lifecycle":{"state":"available","status":"completed","finish":{"turnOrdinal":2,"eventOrdinal":19}}},{"id":"[\"niceeval.logical-tool-occurrence/1\",\"session-1\",\"turn-2\",2,21]","session":"session-1","turn":"turn-2","name":{"original":"command_execution","canonical":"shell"},"input":{"state":"complete","value":{"command":"/bin/bash -lc \"grep -nE '\"'^class .*Message'\"' letta/schemas/letta_message.py && sed -n '600,705p' letta/server/rest_api/routers/v1/agents.py\""}},"output":{"state":"complet